<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="June 2026">
  <p>
    SuretyOS is a pre-launch company validating demand for surety bond agency
    software. This page describes how we handle information collected through this
    site while we are in the founding phase.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When you apply to the Founding Program, we collect the details you submit:
    your name, work email, agency name, the bond types you write, your monthly
    bond volume, and any notes you choose to share about your workflow. We do not
    collect this information any other way on this site.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your details only to evaluate founding applications and to contact you
    about the Founding Program. We do not sell your information, and we do not
    share it with third parties except the service providers that help us operate
    (for example, our database and email delivery vendors).
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the information you submitted at
    any time. Email <a href="mailto:info@citisoftsolutions.com">info@citisoftsolutions.com</a> and
    we will take care of it.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:info@citisoftsolutions.com">info@citisoftsolutions.com</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
